{"type":"text","timestamp":1782354957786,"sessionID":"ses_10364f608ffe3SNGhX4sWtXwgr","part":{"id":"prt_efca2298f001bQ8B39hb39nnzU","messageID":"msg_efca1ffa6001G2DPuOqLFVZR0m","sessionID":"ses_10364f608ffe3SNGhX4sWtXwgr","type":"text","text":"     All 10 tests pass. Let me also add a quick smoke test for the server tool dispatch, and update README with instructions. But the task says make code builds and tests pass. Maybe adding a README update isn't necessary but helpful. Also consider adding an integration test that uses MCP SDK in-memory transport if needed. But the main requirements are met.\n\nCheck if dist/index.js executable? package.json start points to it. I included shebang in index.ts which becomes dist/index.js after build. Good.\n\nAlso need to ensure node_modules are not weirdly processed. Looks fine.\n\nI should write a quick smoke test for tools handlers maybe via the server perhaps using the types. But tests already cover engine. The MCP server dispatch is thin. I'll add a small unit test for format functions to improve BDD coverage. Actually 10 tests is good.\n\nLet me update todos. </think> ","time":{"start":1782354946447,"end":1782354957783}}}
